@TsaiAnson @ryan-lund I'm reworking the Tilelink transactions so that they can be randomized using the constrained random API. The user-facing API for constructing TL transactions remains mostly the same.

@TsaiAnson If we have a generic Put transaction with a given mask, can we determine whether it is a PutFullData or PutPartialData based on that alone (whether the mask is contiguous)?

Also is a PutFullBurst just a sequence of PutFull transactions that are sent without delays (without deasserting valid) from the driver? If so we can just make bursts aliased to Seq[Put] and have the Put transactions unrolled in the driver.

